.SH "NEW OPTIONS (Category A/B/C)"

.SS "Pacing"
.TP
.BR \-\-pacing \ \fIuniform|adaptive|gaussian|review\fR
Timing mode (default: uniform).
.RS
.TP
uniform
Fixed delays, no modification
.TP
adaptive
Speed up for long runs of same-type ops (20% faster after 5 ops, 40% after 10, 60% after 20)
.TP
gaussian
Add +-N% random jitter to each delay for human-like typing
.TP
review
Everything 2x slower for code review mode
.RE
.TP
.BI \-\-gaussian-jitter-pct \ N
Jitter percentage for gaussian mode (default: 20)
.TP
.BI \-\-pause-after-lines \ N
Pause after every N changed lines (default: 0=off)
.TP
.BI \-\-pause-after-threshold \ N
Only pause if file has >N lines (default: 50)
.TP
.BI \-\-pause-after-ms \ N
Pause duration in ms (default: 500)

.SS "Delete strategies"
.TP
.BR \-\-delete-pacing \ \fIchar|rapid-eol|rapid-identical|word|instant\fR
Deletion strategy (default: word)
.TP
.B \-\-accel-delete
Enable multi-line accelerated deletion (slow start, accelerate, slow end)
.TP
.BI \-\-accel-delete-start-ms \ N
Initial slow delay for accel-delete (default: 80)
.TP
.BI \-\-accel-delete-min-ms \ N
Minimum accelerated delay (default: 10)
.TP
.BI \-\-accel-delete-accel \ F
Acceleration factor 0.0-1.0 (default: 0.85)
.TP
.BI \-\-block-delete-size \ N
Group deletes into blocks of N, pause before/after (default: 3)
.TP
.BI \-\-pause-before-delete-ms \ N
Pause before a delete block (default: 200)
.TP
.BI \-\-pause-after-delete-ms \ N
Pause after a delete block (default: 200)

.SS "Highlighting and display"
.TP
.BR \-\-highlight \ \fInone|inline|word|hunk\fR
Highlight mode (default: none)
.TP
.BI \-\-highlight-duration-ms \ N
Highlight duration in ms (default: 200)
.TP
.B \-\-dim-unchanged
Dim unchanged anchor lines
.TP
.BI \-\-dim-unchanged-pct \ N
Dimming percentage 0-100 (default: 60)
.TP
.BI \-\-context \ N
Fold unchanged regions >2N lines, keep N context lines
.TP
.B \-\-fold-unchanged
Fold all unchanged regions
.TP
.B \-\-sign-column
Show +/- signs in the sign column
.TP
.B \-\-git-blame
Echo git blame for the target line of each hunk
.TP
.BI \-\-max-hunk-chars \ N
Skip animation for hunks with >N changed chars (0=off)
.TP
.BR \-\-theme \ \fIdark|light|high-contrast\fR
Color theme for highlights

.SS "Startup and control"
.TP
.B \-\-step-mode
Space advances one op at a time (starts paused)
.TP
.B \-\-startup-pause
Show config + help before starting
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Enable verbose logging to /tmp/diffvim-debug.log
.TP
.BI \-\-log-mode \ 1|2
Generate a log file without starting vim
.TP
.BI \-\-log-file \ FILE
Write log to FILE (default: diffvim.log)
.TP
.B \-\-no-log-timing
Disable timing info in log output

.SS "Scroll"
.TP
.BR \-\-scroll \ \fIzz|zt|zb|none\fR
Scroll cursor to center/top/bottom/none (default: zz)

